swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id9647511				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>By using the @WIKIEXTENSIONPRODUCTNAME@ you can upload your current Writer text document to a MediaWiki server. After uploading, all Wiki users can read your document on the Wiki.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id6468703				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - Send - To MediaWiki\</item\> to upload the current Writer document to a MediaWiki server.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	hd_id4554582				0	ta	தேவையான வன்பொருள்				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id2597430				0	ta	StarOffice/StarSuite 9				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id8430738				0	ta	OpenOffice.org 3.0				20200411 15:09:53
