swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id7387615				0	ta	ஒரு விக்கி கணக்கு துணைபுரியும் \<link href=\"http://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/MediaWiki\"\>MediaWiki\</link\> சேவையகத்தில்				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	hd_id8047120				0	ta	@WIKIEXTENSIONPRODUCTNAME@ஐ நிறுவுகிறது				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id4277169				0	ta	Before you install the @WIKIEXTENSIONPRODUCTNAME@, ensure that StarOffice or OpenOffice.org uses a Java Runtime Environment (JRE). To check the status of the JRE, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Options - StarOffice/OpenOffice.org - Java\</item\>. Ensure that "Use a Java runtime environment" is marked and that a Java runtime folder is selected in the big listbox. If no JRE was activated, then activate a JRE 1.4 or later and restart StarOffice/OpenOffice.org.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	hd_id567339				0	ta	@WIKIEXTENSIONPRODUCTNAME@ஐ நிறுவ				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id1732230				0	ta	In a Writer window, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Extension Manager\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id4338511				0	ta	விரிவாக்க மேலாளர் உரையாடலில், சேர் என்பதை சொடுக்கவும்				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id5882442				0	ta	Locate the @WIKIEXTENSIONFILENAME@.oxt file, click Open, and then click Close. 				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id4008911				0	ta	Close %PRODUCTNAME, and close also the Quickstarter if enabled.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id265511				0	ta	Restart the software, open a text document, then choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Options - Internet - MediaWiki\</item\> to enter your Wiki settings. See "To Connect To a Wiki" below.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	hd_id3569444				0	ta	@WIKIEXTENSIONPRODUCTNAME@ஐ நீக்க				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id2655110				0	ta	In a Writer window, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Extension Manager\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id9504379				0	ta	Click the plus sign (+) in front of My Extensions.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id8431348				0	ta	Select the extension, click Remove, and then click Close.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	hd_id5316019				0	ta	ஒரு விக்கிக்கு இணைக்க				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id2381969				0	ta	Note: You can store your user name and password for all respective dialogs inside StarOffice/OpenOffice.org. The password will be stored in a secure way, where access is maintained by a master password. To enable the master password, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Options - StarOffice/OpenOffice.org - Security\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id3751640				0	ta	Note: If you connect to the web using a proxy server, enter the proxy information to \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Options - Internet - Proxy\</item\>, and restart the software.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id9533677				0	ta	Open a Writer document, and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Options - Internet - MediaWiki\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id368968				0	ta	In the \<link href=\"@WIKIEXTENSIONID@/wikisettings.xhp\"\>Options\</link\> dialog, click Add.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id6962187				0	ta	In the \<link href=\"@WIKIEXTENSIONID@/wikiaccount.xhp\"\>MediaWiki\</link\> dialog, enter the account information for the Wiki.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id5328836				0	ta	In the URL textbox, enter the address of a Wiki that you want to connect to.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id389416				0	ta	நீங்கள் உலாவியிலிருந்து வலைச்சுட்டியை  நகலெடுத்து அதனை உரைப்பெட்டியில் ஒட்டலாம்.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id5906552				0	ta	In the Username box, enter your user ID for your Wiki account.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id9297158				0	ta	விகி அனுமதித்தால் உபயோகிப்பாளர் ெபயர் மற்றும் கடவுச் சொல் தரவேண்டிய பெட்டிகளை காலியாக விடலாம்.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id8869594				0	ta	In the Password box, enter the password for your Wiki account, then click OK.				20200411 15:09:53
swext	mediawiki\help\wiki.xhp	0	help	par_id292062				0	ta	Optionally enable "Save password" to save the password between sessions. A master password is used to maintain access to all saved passwords. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Options - StarOffice/OpenOffice.org - Security\</item\> to enable the master password. "Save password" is unavailable when the master password is not enabled.				20200411 15:09:53
