helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3159201				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OFA_HYPERLINK_DLG\"\>Use the \<emph\>Hyperlink\</emph\> Bar to create and edit the hyperlinks in your documents, and to enter criteria for searches using the available Internet search engines.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
