helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760	2			0	ta	\<variable id=\"basic\"\>$[officename] can be controlled by using the $[officename] API. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151111				0	ta	$[officename] provides an Application Programming Interface (API) that enables you to control $[officename] components by using various programming languages. A $[officename] Software Development Kit is available for the programming interface.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346				0	ta	For more information about $[officename] API reference, please visit \<link href=\"https://api.openoffice.org/\"\>api.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825				0	ta	Macros created with $[officename] Basic based on the old programming interface will no longer be supported by the current version.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149795				0	ta	For more information on $[officename] Basic, select "$[officename] Basic" in the list box.				20200411 15:09:53
