helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100600.xhp	0	help	par_id3159414				0	ta	\<emph\>Expression:\</emph\> Any numerical expression that you want to convert. If the \<emph\>Expression\</emph\> lies outside the valid long integer range between -2.147.483.648 and 2.147.483.647, $[officename] Basic returns an overflow error. To convert a string expression, the number must be entered as normal text ("123.5") using the default number format of your operating system.				20200411 15:09:53
