helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	ta	Defxxx Characterrange1[, Characterrange2[,...]]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156344				0	ta	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147560				0	ta	\<emph\>Characterrange:\</emph\> Letters that specify the range of variables that you want to set a default data type for.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398				0	ta	\<emph\>xxx:\</emph\> Keyword that defines the default variable type:				20200411 15:09:53
