helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150046				0	ta	Click the module to be renamed twice, with a pause between the clicks. Enter the new name.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153801				0	ta	In the Basic IDE, right-click the name of the module or dialog in the tabs at the bottom of the screen, choose \<emph\>Rename\</emph\> and type in the new name.				20200411 15:09:53
