helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	ta	Sub ExampleImp				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145272				0	ta	Dim A as Variant, B as Variant, C as Variant, D as Variant				20200411 15:09:53
