helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149655				0	ta	Returns the year from a serial date number that is generated by the DateSerial or the DateValue function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154125				0	ta	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147229				0	ta	Year (Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154685				0	ta	Return value:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030106.xhp	0	help	par_id3153970				0	ta	Integer				20200411 15:09:53
