helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163712				0	ta	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> Integer expression that contains the serial date number that is used to calculate the year.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596	9			0	ta	This function is the opposite of the \<emph\>DateSerial \</emph\>function, and returns the year of a serial date. For example, the expression:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	ta	Print Year(DateSerial(1994, 12, 20))				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149483				0	ta	returns the value 1994.				20200411 15:09:53
