helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030202.xhp\" name=\"Minute Function [Runtime]\"\>Minute Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156344				0	ta	Returns the minute of the hour that corresponds to the serial time value that is generated by the TimeSerial or the TimeValue function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154758				0	ta	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	ta	Minute (Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148798				0	ta	Return value:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3150449				0	ta	Integer				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153193				0	ta	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153969	8			0	ta	         \<emph\>Number:\</emph\> Numeric expression that contains the serial time value that is used to return the minute value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3150869	9			0	ta	This function is the opposite of the \<emph\>TimeSerial \</emph\>function. It returns the minute of the serial time value that is generated by the \<emph\>TimeSerial\</emph\> or the \<emph\>TimeValue \</emph\>function. For example, the expression:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262				0	ta	Print Minute(TimeSerial(12,30,41))				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3148576				0	ta	returns the value 30.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150010				0	ta	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3159154				0	ta	Sub ExampleMinute				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	ta	MsgBox "The current minute is "& Minute(Now)& "."				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	ta	end sub				20200411 15:09:53
