helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080401.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156027				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03080401.xhp\" name=\"Sqr Function [Runtime]\"\>Sqr Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080401.xhp	0	help	par_id3147226				0	ta	Calculates the square root of a numeric expression.				20200411 15:09:53
