helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120312.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152801				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03120312.xhp\" name=\"ConvertToURL Function [Runtime]\"\>ConvertToURL Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120312.xhp	0	help	par_id3148538				0	ta	Converts a system file name to a file URL.				20200411 15:09:53
