helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150986				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03060500.xhp\" name=\"Or-Operator [Runtime]\"\>Or Operator [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552				0	ta	Performs a logical OR disjunction on two expressions.				20200411 15:09:53
