helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030301.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	ta	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Only required in order to reset the system date. In this case, the string expression must correspond to the date format defined in your local settings.				20200411 15:09:53
