helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030108.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153127				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030108.xhp\" name=\"CDateFromIso Function [Runtime]\"\>CDateFromIso Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030108.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	ta	Returns the internal date number from a string that contains a date in ISO format.				20200411 15:09:53
