helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148664				0	ta	MsgBox Text As String [,Type As Integer [,Dialogtitle As String]] (As Statement) or MsgBox (Text As String [,Type As Integer [,Dialogtitle As String]]) (As Function)				20200411 15:09:53
