helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020402.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145068				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020402.xhp\" name=\"ChDrive Statement [Runtime]\"\>ChDrive Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020402.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	ta	Changes the current drive.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020402.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154138				0	ta	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
