helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020402.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	ta	ChDrive "D" REM Only possible if a drive 'D' exists.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020402.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	ta	End Sub				20200411 15:09:53
