helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156344				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03060200.xhp\" name=\"Eqv Operator [Runtime]\"\>Eqv Operator [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	ta	Calculates the logical equivalence of two expressions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154367				0	ta	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910				0	ta	Result = Expression1 Eqv Expression2				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151043				0	ta	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150869				0	ta	\<emph\>Result:\</emph\> Any numeric variable that contains the result of the comparison.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150448				0	ta	\<emph\>Expression1, Expression2:\</emph\> Any expressions that you want to compare.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149562				0	ta	When testing for equivalence between Boolean expressions, the result is \<emph\>True\</emph\> if both expressions are either \<emph\>True\</emph\> or \<emph\>False\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	ta	In a bit-wise comparison, the Eqv operator only sets the corresponding bit in the result if a bit is set in both expressions, or in neither expression.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159154				0	ta	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147426				0	ta	Sub ExampleEqv				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155308				0	ta	Dim A as Variant, B as Variant, C as Variant, D as Variant				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146986				0	ta	Dim vOut as Variant				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	ta	A = 10: B = 8: C = 6: D = Null				20200411 15:09:53
