helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155529				0	ta	...before a document is saved with \<emph\>File - Save\</emph\> or the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> icon, provided that a document name has already been specified.				20200411 15:09:53
