helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147242				0	ta	\<bookmark_value\>GoSub...Return statement\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147242				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090301.xhp\" name=\"GoSub...Return Statement [Runtime]\"\>GoSub...Return Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3145316	2			0	ta	Calls a subroutine that is indicated by a label from a subroutine or a function. The statements following the label are executed until the next Return statement. Afterwards, the program continues with the statement that follows the \<emph\>GoSub \</emph\>statement.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145609				0	ta	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	ta	see Parameters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147265				0	ta	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3148664				0	ta	Sub/Function				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400				0	ta	statement block				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154140	8			0	ta	 Label				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150869				0	ta	statement block				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909				0	ta	GoSub Label				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153969				0	ta	Exit Sub/Function				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154685				0	ta	Label:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786				0	ta	statement block				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252				0	ta	Return				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154321				0	ta	End Sub/Function				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3147318				0	ta	The \<emph\>GoSub\</emph\> statement calls a local subroutine indicated by a label from within a subroutine or a function. The name of the label must end with a colon (":").				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153190				0	ta	If the program encounters a Return statement not preceded by \<emph\>GoSub\</emph\>, $[officename] Basic returns an error message. Use \<emph\>Exit Sub\</emph\> or \<emph\>Exit Function\</emph\> to ensure that the program leaves a Sub or Function before reaching the next Return statement.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3145799				0	ta	The following example demonstrates the use of \<emph\>GoSub\</emph\> and \<emph\>Return\</emph\>. By executing a program section twice, the program calculates the square root of two numbers that are entered by the user.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156284				0	ta	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073				0	ta	Sub ExampleGoSub				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154097				0	ta	dim iInputa as Single				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	ta	dim iInputb as Single				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153416				0	ta	dim iInputc as Single				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3146970				0	ta	iInputa = Int(InputBox$ ("Enter the first number: ","NumberInput"))				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150329				0	ta	iInputb = Int(InputBox$ ("Enter the second number: ","NumberInput"))				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3156277				0	ta	iInputc=iInputa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150321				0	ta	GoSub SquareRoot				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154756				0	ta	Print "The square root of";iInputa;" is";iInputc				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3155764				0	ta	iInputc=iInputb				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960				0	ta	GoSub SquareRoot				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3147340				0	ta	Print "The square root of";iInputb;" is";iInputc				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3166450				0	ta	Exit Sub				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3155176				0	ta	SquareRoot:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3149257				0	ta	iInputc=sqr(iInputc)				20200411 15:09:53
