helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684				0	ta	\<emph\>Position:\</emph\> For files opened in Random mode, \<emph\>Position\</emph\> is the number of the record that you want to read.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	ta	For files opened in Binary mode, \<emph\>Position\</emph\> is the byte position in the file where the reading starts.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147319				0	ta	If \<emph\>Position\</emph\> is omitted, the current position or the current data record of the file is used.				20200411 15:09:53
