helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\02\11060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:BasicStepOver\"\>Runs the macro and stops it after the next procedure.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\02\11060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	ta	You can use this command in conjunction with the \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/02/11080000.xhp\" name=\"Watch\"\>Watch\</link\> command to troubleshoot errors.				20200411 15:09:53
