helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\02\20000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153575				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Radiobutton\"\>Adds a button that allows a user to select from a number of options.\</ahelp\> Grouped option buttons must have consecutive tab indices. They are commonly encircled by a group box. If you have two groups of option buttons, you must insert a tab index between the tab indices of the two groups on the group frame.				20200411 15:09:53
