helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159224				0	ta	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"HID_OFA_HYPERLINK_SEARCH\"\>Click and choose one of the Internet search engines from the submenu. The search term is entered in the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\> The list of search engines in the \<emph\>Find\</emph\> submenu is defined in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01020200.xhp\" name=\"Internet - Search\"\>Internet - Search\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	ta	\<image src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_recsearch.png\" id=\"img_id3153750\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153750\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	ta	Find				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153683				0	ta	List of search engines				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	ta	When you have selected a search engine, $[officename] transfers the search request to your standard web browser, which then establishes an Internet connection to the search engine and displays the result. See also \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09010000.xhp\" name=\"URL Name\"\>URL Name\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Move Up				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144740				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/06100000.xhp\" name=\"Move Up\"\>Move Up\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3109850				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MoveUp\"\>Positions the selected paragraph before the one above it.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283	5			0	ta	If you have numbered paragraphs and click the\<emph\> Move Up \</emph\>icon, the numbers will be adjusted to the current order. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>The \<emph\>Move Up \</emph\>icon is only visible when the cursor is positioned in a bulleted or numbered list.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>The \<emph\>Move Up \</emph\>icon appears on the \<emph\>Text Formatting\</emph\> Bar when you use the outline view.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	ta	This function can be called by pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Up Arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
