helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159224				0	ta	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\".uno:DBViewFunctions\"\>Displays the "Function" row in the lower part of the design view of the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/02010100.xhp\" name=\"Query Design\"\>Query Design\</link\> window.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
