helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	ta	STD				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152780				0	ta	Standard mode				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	ta	Click in text where you want to position the cursor; click in a cell to make it the active cell. Any other selection is then deselected.				20200411 15:09:53
