helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149580				0	ta	Extension mode (F8)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717				0	ta	Clicking in the text extends or crops the current selection.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154047				0	ta	ADD				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147620				0	ta	Additional selection mode (Shift+F8)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307				0	ta	A new selection is added to an existing selection. The result is a multiple selection.				20200411 15:09:53
