helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_RB_LINKTYP_MAIL\"\>Assigns the specified e-mail address to the hyperlink.\</ahelp\> Clicking the new hyperlink in the document will open a new message document, addressed to the receiver specified in the \<emph\>E-mail\</emph\> field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155628				0	ta	News				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149955				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_RB_LINKTYP_NEWS\"\>Assigns a news address to the hyperlink.\</ahelp\> Clicking the hyperlink in the document will open a new message document to the news group you entered in the \<emph\>Receiver\</emph\> field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149580				0	ta	Receiver				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HYPERDLG_MAIL_PATH\"\>Specifies the full URL of the addressee, in the form mailto:name@provider.com or news:group.server.com.\</ahelp\> You can also use drag-and-drop.				20200411 15:09:53
