helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150976	14			0	ta	The\<emph\> Value \</emph\>list box contains all possible values for the specified \<emph\>Field name\</emph\> . Choose the value to be used in the filter. You can also choose the \<emph\>- empty -\</emph\> or \<emph\>-not empty -\</emph\> entries..				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156118	15			0	ta	If you use the filter function in database tables or forms, then type the value in the \<emph\>Value \</emph\>text box to be used for filtering.				20200411 15:09:53
