helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154228				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MoveDown\"\>Positions the selected paragraph after the one below it.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158405	5			0	ta	If you have numbered paragraphs and click the\<emph\> Move Down \</emph\>icon, the numbers will be adjusted to the current order. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>The \<emph\>Move Down \</emph\>icon is only visible when the cursor is positioned in a bulleted or numbered list. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>The \<emph\>Move Down \</emph\>icon appears on the \<emph\>Text Formatting\</emph\> Bar when you use the outline view. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149751				0	ta	This function can be called by pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Down Arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3153577\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_outlinedown.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153577\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
