helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3161659	41			0	ta	\<variable id=\"siehe\"\>See also the following functions: \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147418				0	ta	\<variable id=\"regulaer\"\>The search supports \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02100001.xhp\" name=\"regular expressions\"\>regular expressions\</link\>. You can enter "all.*", for example to find the first location of "all" followed by any characters. If you want to search for a text that is also a regular expression, you must precede every character with a \\ character. You can switch the automatic evaluation of regular expression on and off in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060500.xhp\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - Calculate\</link\>.\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3163714	56			0	ta	\<variable id=\"wahr\"\>If an error occurs, the function returns a logical or numerical value. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
