helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_ASCII:CKB_TAB\"\>Separates data delimited by tabs into columns.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154317				0	ta	Semicolon				20200411 15:09:53
