helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id783149793				0	ta	Quote all text cells				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3152778363				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Exports all text cells with leading and trailing quote characters as set in the Text delimiter box. If not checked, only those text cells get quoted that contain the Field delimiter character.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id7145298				0	ta	Save cell content as shown				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id5719779				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enabled by default, data will be saved as displayed, including applied number formats. If this checkbox is not marked, raw data content will be saved, as in older versions of the software.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3541062				0	ta	Depending on the number format, saving cell content as shown may write values that during an import cannot be interpreted as numerical values anymore.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149793				0	ta	Fixed column width				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCDLG_IMPORTOPT_CB_FIXEDWIDTH\"\>Exports all data fields with a fixed width.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283				0	ta	The width of a data field in the exported text file is set to the current width of the corresponding column.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3154116				0	ta	Values are exported in the format as currently seen in the cell.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3156414				0	ta	If a value is longer than the fixed column width, it will be exported as a ### string.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3150178				0	ta	If a text string is longer than the fixed column width, it will be truncated at the end.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3148548				0	ta	The alignment Left, Centered, and Right will be simulated by inserted blanks.				20200411 15:09:53
