helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000408.xhp	0	help	par_id3147240	14			0	ta	\<variable id=\"infoanwendung\"\>Choose \<emph\>Help - About \</emph\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME\</emph\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000408.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387	15			0	ta	Automatically after \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> is first started.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000408.xhp	0	help	par_id3153808	16			0	ta	Choose \<emph\>Help - Registration\</emph\> (this is a direct link to an external website)				20200411 15:09:53
