helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144766				0	ta	The \<emph\>Euro Converter\</emph\> dialog contains the following functions:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148387				0	ta	Entire document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150113				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_CHECKBOX1\"\>Converts the entire document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159110				0	ta	Currencies				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148834				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_COMBOBOX1\"\>Specifies the currency to be converted into euros.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155084				0	ta	Selection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152999				0	ta	Select the cells you want to convert in this range, if you did not mark the \<emph\>Entire document\</emph\> check box. Select an option and then click the desired entries in the \<emph\>Templates\</emph\> / \<emph\>Currency ranges\</emph\> field. The selected range will be visible as such in the document. Click \<emph\>Convert\</emph\> to carry out the conversion.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153950				0	ta	Cell Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145162				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_OPTIONBUTTON1\"\>All cells with the selected Cell Styles are converted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152974				0	ta	Currency cells in the current sheet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154479				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_OPTIONBUTTON2\"\>All currency cells in the active spreadsheet will be converted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156276				0	ta	Currency cells in the entire document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146912				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_OPTIONBUTTON3\"\>All currency cells in the active document will be converted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155444				0	ta	Selected range				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153736				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_OPTIONBUTTON4\"\>All currency cells in the range selected before the converter was called will be converted.\</ahelp\> All cells must have the same format so that they can be recognized as a selected range.				20200411 15:09:53
