helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	ta	Welcome				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10566				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Start-up Wizard helps you to specify the user settings for %PRODUCTNAME. This wizard only runs once.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10575				0	ta	License				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10579				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Read and accept the license text to continue. You need to scroll to the end of the license text before you can continue. If you decline the license, the installation is canceled.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
