helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829				0	ta	On the first page you can select an existing design or create a new one.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	ta	The settings you select for the export will be automatically saved as a design for other exports. You can enter the design name after clicking \<emph\>Create\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151226				0	ta	Assign design				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	ta	In this area, you can choose to create a new design and select or delete an existing design.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147291				0	ta	If you delete a design, you will only delete the design information in the Wizard. An export file will not be deleted by this action.				20200411 15:09:53
