helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01020000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150445				0	ta	\<bookmark_value\>wizards;faxes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>faxes;wizards\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>templates;faxes\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150445				0	ta	Fax Wizard				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394	2			0	ta	\<variable id=\"fax\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoPilotFax\"\>Opens the wizard for faxes.\</ahelp\> The wizard can help you create document templates for fax documents. You can then print the fax documents to a printer or to a fax machine, if fax driver software is available. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154824				0	ta	$[officename] comes with a template for fax documents, which you can modify with the wizard to suit your own needs. The wizard leads you step-by-step in creating a document template, and offers numerous layout and design options. The document preview gives you an impression of how the finished fax will appear.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	ta	Within the dialog you can modify your entries and options at any time. You can also skip an entire page or even all the wizard pages, in which case the current (or default) settings will remain in effect.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156156				0	ta	Back				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155628	6			0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click the\<emph\> Back \</emph\>button to view the settings chosen on the previous page. The current settings will not be modified or deleted if you click this button.\<emph\> Back \</emph\>will be active from the second page onwards.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147335				0	ta	Next				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156117	8			0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The wizard saves the current settings and goes to the next page. The\<emph\> Next \</emph\>button will become inactive once you have reached the last page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152350				0	ta	Finish				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146948	10			0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>According to your selections, the wizard creates a document template and saves it. A new document based on the template appears in the work area, with the filename "UntitledX".\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Purchase %PRODUCTNAME				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10564				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/purchase.xhp\"\>Purchase %PRODUCTNAME\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10574				0	ta	This wizard is visible for the evaluation version of %PRODUCTNAME. If you are using a time-limited evaluation version of %PRODUCTNAME, you can purchase a license online. You will get a serial number to change your %PRODUCTNAME to a full version.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10577				0	ta	The wizard can be called any time from the Help menu. The wizard will be offered automatically starting five days before the evaluation period expires.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057A				0	ta	The wizard consists of the following steps:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057D				0	ta	Purchase %PRODUCTNAME				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10581				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>This is the welcome page of the wizard. If you want to buy a serial number online, click the button. If you already have a serial number, click Next to enter the number on the next page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10590				0	ta	Get your serial number online				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10594				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click to enter a web page, where you can purchase a serial number online.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A3				0	ta	Unlock %PRODUCTNAME				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A7				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter your serial number or copy and paste the number from the online web page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B6				0	ta	License Agreement				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BA				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Please read the license text (scroll down the text accordingly), then accept the license to continue unlocking. If you do not accept the license, the software will not be unlocked.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C9				0	ta	Personal Data				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CD				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>This step of the wizard appears when the unlocking program finds an installed version of %PRODUCTNAME where some user settings can be copied to the new installation.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105DC				0	ta	Copy personal data				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E0				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select this box to copy your user name and other data from a previous installation to your new installation of %PRODUCTNAME.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105EF				0	ta	Summary				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F3				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>This is the last page of the Purchase %PRODUCTNAME Wizard.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
