helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200803204063				0	ta	Welcome to %PRODUCTNAME. Thank you for using the %PRODUCTNAME \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\"\>application help\</link\>. Press F1 whenever you need help using the %PRODUCTNAME software.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200802524413				0	ta	You see the Start Center when no document is open in %PRODUCTNAME. \<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click an icon to open a new document or a file dialog.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200803104810				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The document icons each open a new document of the specified type.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
