helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200803105015				0	ta	               \<emph\>Formula\</emph\> opens %PRODUCTNAME \<link href=\"text/smath/main0000.xhp\"\>Math\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id1022200911011855				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The Templates icon opens the Templates and Documents dialog.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200803105045				0	ta	The \<emph\>Templates\</emph\> icon opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/aaa_start.xhp\"\>Templates and Documents\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id1022200911011975				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The Open icon presents a file open dialog.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
