helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3155388				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Customize\"\>Tools - Customize\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
