helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	ta	\<emph\>Extended tips\</emph\> provide a brief description of the function of a particular icon, text box or menu command when you rest your cursor on that item.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155339				0	ta	To turn Extended Tips on and off:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	ta	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>, and check \<emph\>Extended tips\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	ta	A check mark indicates that the extended tips are activated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149811				0	ta	To turn Extended Tips on temporarily:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3153541				0	ta	Press the shortcut keys Shift+F1 to activate extended tips once.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825				0	ta	A question mark appears beside the mouse pointer. You can move this \<emph\>Help Mouse Pointer\</emph\> over all controls, icons and menu commands to obtain a description of the command. The \<emph\>Help Mouse Pointer\</emph\> is disabled the next time you click the mouse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\formfields.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Inserting and Editing Buttons				20200411 15:09:53
