helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B5				0	ta	Click the Fontwork object. If the Fontwork object is inserted in the background, hold down the Ctrl key while you click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B8				0	ta	The \<link href=\"text/shared/fontwork_toolbar.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\>\</link\> toolbar is displayed. If you do not see the \<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\> toolbar, choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Fontwork\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BC				0	ta	Click an icon in the \<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN10839				0	ta	The following icons are available:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C5				0	ta	Fontwork Gallery - adds another Fontwork object				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C9				0	ta	Fontwork Shape - edits the shape				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CD				0	ta	Fontwork Same Letter Heights - changes the height of characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	ta	Fontwork Alignment - aligns the text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D9				0	ta	Fontwork Character Spacing - changes the character spacing and kerning				20200411 15:09:53
