helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\aaa_start.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156211				0	ta	How to simplify your work using samples and templates				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\aaa_start.xhp	0	help	par_id3144436				0	ta	\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> includes many sample documents and ready-to-use templates. You can access these by choosing \<emph\>File - New - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010100.xhp\" name=\"Templates and Documents\"\>\<emph\>Templates and Documents\</emph\>\</link\>, or press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+N.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\aaa_start.xhp	0	help	par_id3147291				0	ta	When you open one of the templates, a new document is created based on this template.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\aaa_start.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200803563860				0	ta	Click the \<emph\>Get more templates online\</emph\> link in the dialog to select and download more templates.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\aaa_start.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200803563974				0	ta	You can also use the various wizards (under the \<emph\>File - Wizards\</emph\> menu) to create your own templates, which you can use as a basis for further documents.				20200411 15:09:53
