helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AC0				0	ta	You can distribute an XML filter to multiple users using a special package format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AC3				0	ta	To Save an XML Filter as a Package				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10ACD				0	ta	The XML Filter Settings dialog is only available when a text document is open.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10ACA				0	ta	In Writer, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - XML Filter Settings\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AD9				0	ta	Select the filter that you want to distribute and click \<emph\>Save As Package\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AE0				0	ta	To Install an XML Filter from a Package				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AEA				0	ta	The XML Filter Settings dialog is only available when a text document is opened.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AE7				0	ta	In Writer, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - XML Filter Settings\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AF6				0	ta	Click \<emph\>Open Package\</emph\> and select the package file with the filter you want to install.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10535				0	ta	To Delete an Installed XML Filter				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B0A				0	ta	In Writer, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - XML Filter Settings\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B19				0	ta	Select the filter you want to delete and click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
