helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id1376079				0	ta	On the horizontal ruler you can see the tab stops for the current paragraph. If you want to change the tab stops, you should first consider the scope to which you want to change tab stops as follows:				20200411 15:09:53
