helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id6178167				0	ta	In the following, you find instructions for all above mentioned tasks.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008	27			0	ta	You can set a tab stop by clicking on the ruler or by selecting \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Tabs.\</emph\> Both methods affect the current paragraph or all selected paragraphs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3155136				0	ta	Click the ruler once to set a left-justified tab. Right-click a tab icon on the ruler to see the context menu in which you can change the tab type.				20200411 15:09:53
