helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	ta	$[officename] can open and save documents in the Microsoft Office file formats. Microsoft Office Open XML formats can be read, but not saved.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145345				0	ta	Opening a Microsoft Office File				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	ta	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\>. Select a Microsoft Office file in the $[officename] file open dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346				0	ta	MS Office file...				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342				0	ta	...will open in $[officename] module				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3153543				0	ta	MS Word, *.doc, *.docx				20200411 15:09:53
