helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	ta	Select from the available sections and make the required changes (for example, select the \<emph\>Scale\</emph\> tab if you want to modify the scale of the axis).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3156327				0	ta	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. In your document, click outside the chart to exit chart editing mode.				20200411 15:09:53
