helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	ta	Double-click a closed folder to open it and display the subfolders and Help pages.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3150506				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3156426\" src=\"sfx2/res/hlpbookopen.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156426\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	ta	Double-click an open folder to close it and hide the subfolders and Help pages.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3150255\" src=\"sfx2/res/hlpdoc.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150255\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3152909				0	ta	Double-click a document icon to display the corresponding Help page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3158432				0	ta	Use the arrow keys in combination with the Return key to drop down and roll up entries and to open documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Icons in the Documentation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153116				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000002.xhp\" name=\"Icons in the Documentation\"\>Icons in the Documentation\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154962				0	ta	Icons in the Documentation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146961				0	ta	There are three icons used to call your attention to additional helpful information.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156152				0	ta	The "Important!" icon points out important information regarding data and system security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	ta	The "Note" icon points out extra information: for example, alternative ways to reach a certain goal.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216				0	ta	The "Tip" icon points out tips for working with the program in a more efficient manner.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150672				0	ta	\<bookmark_value\>Help; Help tips\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tooltips; help\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Help Agent; help\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Clippy, see Help Agent\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155599				0	ta	\<variable id=\"00000120\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000120.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips\"\>Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520	2			0	ta	The Help Agent, Tips, and Extended Tips provide help while you work. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147285				0	ta	The Help Agent				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	ta	The \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010600.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent\"\>Help Agent\</link\> starts automatically when you are performing a task that might require some assistance. The Help Agent appears in a small window in a corner of the document. To view the help for the task, click inside the Help Agent window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10634				0	ta	The Help Agent automatically closes after a short delay. If you ignore or close the Help Agent three times you perform a certain task, the Help Agent no longer opens for that task. To disable the Help Agent choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140				0	ta	Tips				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3157896				0	ta	Tips provide you with the names of toolbar buttons. To display a tip, rest the pointer over a toolbar button until the name of the button appears.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910				0	ta	Tips are also displayed for some elements in a document, such as chapter names when you scroll through a long document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id992156				0	ta	Enable or disable the tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147571				0	ta	Extended Tips				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	ta	Extended tips provide a brief description about buttons and commands. To display an extended tip, press Shift+F1, then point to a button or command.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10666				0	ta	If you always want extended tips instead of tips, enable the extended tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	ta	\<variable id=\"00000110\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window\"\>The \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Help Window\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183				0	ta	The Help system for all versions of the software is based on the same source files. Some of the functions described in Help may not be included in this particular distribution. Some features specific to a distribution may not be mentioned in this Help.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147143	2			0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:HelpOnHelp\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Provides an overview of the Help system\</ahelp\>The Help window shows the currently selected Help page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3159201				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOX\"\>The \<emph\>Toolbar\</emph\> contains important functions for controlling the Help system\</ahelp\>:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153311				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3155892\" src=\"sfx2/res/indexon_small.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155892\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147089				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_INDEX\"\>Hides and shows the \<emph\>navigation pane\</emph\>\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3152781				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3149811\" src=\"res/sc06301.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149811\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3151111				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_BACKWARD\"\>Moves back to the \<emph\>previous\</emph\> page\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149415				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3159399\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_browseforward.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159399\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154514				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_FORWARD\"\>Moves forward to the \<emph\>next\</emph\> page\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149580				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3148642\" src=\"res/sc06303.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148642\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_START\"\>Moves to the \<emph\>first page\</emph\> of the current Help topic\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149797				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3155434\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_print.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155434\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148563				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_PRINT\"\>\<emph\>Prints\</emph\> the current page\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3149294\" src=\"sfx2/res/favourite.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149294\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154939				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_BOOKMARKS\"\>Adds this page to your bookmarks\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN108D9				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id7358623\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_recsearch.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id7358623\"\>Search icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN108FE				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_SEARCHDIALOG\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Find on this page\</emph\> dialog\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	ta	These commands can also be found in the context menu of the Help document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10922				0	ta	Help Page				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10926				0	ta	You can copy from the Help Viewer to the clipboard on your operating system with standard copy commands. For example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN1092C				0	ta	On a Help page, select the text that you want to copy.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10930				0	ta	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10933				0	ta	To search the current Help page:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10939				0	ta	Click the \<emph\>Find on this Page\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10940				0	ta	The \<emph\>Find on this Page\</emph\> dialog opens.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A36				0	ta	You can also click in the Help page and press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A22				0	ta	In the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> box, enter the text that you want to find.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A48				0	ta	Select the search options that you want to use.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A26				0	ta	Click \<emph\>Find\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A59				0	ta	To find the next occurrence of the search term on the page, click \<emph\>Find\</emph\> again.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10906				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:ComboBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:ED_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the text that you want to search for or select a text entry in the list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10993				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_WHOLEWORDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Finds complete words only.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109AA				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_MATCHCASE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Distinguishes between uppercase text and lowercase text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109C1				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_WRAPAROUND\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Searches the entire Help page, starting at the current position of the cursor.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109D8				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_BACKWARDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Searches backwards from the current position of the cursor.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109F5				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:PushButton:RID_DLG_SEARCH:PB_FIND\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Finds the next occurrence of the search term.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149202				0	ta	Navigation Pane				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148673				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TABCONTROL\"\>The navigation pane of the Help window contains the tab pages \<emph\>Contents\</emph\>, \<emph\>Index\</emph\>, \<emph\>Find\</emph\> and \<emph\>Bookmarks\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3159149				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_LISTBOX\"\>The list box located at the very top is where you can select other \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Help modules.\</ahelp\> The \<emph\>Index\</emph\> and \<emph\>Find\</emph\> tab pages only contain the data for the selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> module.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149983				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000160.xhp\" name=\"Contents\"\>Contents\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145748				0	ta	Displays an index of the main topics of all modules.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3155366				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index\"\>Index\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3151351				0	ta	Displays a list of index keywords for the currently selected %PRODUCTNAME module.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154188				0	ta	Allows you to carry out a full-text search. The search will include the entire Help contents of the currently selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> module.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154985				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000150.xhp\" name=\"Bookmarks\"\>Bookmarks\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156062				0	ta	Contains user-defined bookmarks. You can edit or delete bookmarks, or click them to go to the corresponding pages.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150699				0	ta	The Help references the default settings of the program on a system that is set to defaults. Descriptions of colors, mouse actions, or other configurable items can be different for your program and system.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150618				0	ta	The \<emph\>$[officename] Help system\</emph\> provides easy access to information and support. There are several ways to find what you are looking for in the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"Help environment\"\>Help environment\</link\>: You can search for a specific keyword in the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index\"\>Index\</link\>, carry out a full-text search under \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>, or look through a hierarchical list of the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000160.xhp\" name=\"Topics\"\>Topics\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Managing Bookmarks				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153244				0	ta	\<bookmark_value\>Help; bookmarks\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>bookmarks; Help\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154349				0	ta	\<variable id=\"doc_title\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000150.xhp\" name=\"Managing Bookmarks\"\>Managing Bookmarks\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3154840				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_EDIT_DLG_HELP_ADDBOOKMARK_ED_BOOKMARK_TITLE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the name of the bookmarked page. You can also type a new name for the bookmark.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149140				0	ta	\<image src=\"sfx2/res/favourite.png\" id=\"img_id3149549\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149549\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145314				0	ta	Use the \<emph\>Add to Bookmarks\</emph\> icon to set a bookmark for the current page shown in the Help.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	ta	You can find the bookmarks on the \<emph\>Bookmarks\</emph\> tab page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_BOOKMARKS_LB_BOOKMARKS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Double-clicking a bookmark or pressing the Return key opens the assigned page in Help. A right-click opens the context menu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	ta	Use the Del key to delete a selected bookmark.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	ta	The following commands are on the context menu of a bookmark:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573				0	ta	\<emph\>Display\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_OPEN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>displays the selected help subject\</ahelp\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	ta	\<emph\>Rename\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_RENAME\" visibility=\"visible\"\>opens a dialog for entering another name for the bookmark\</ahelp\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	ta	\<emph\>Delete\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_DELETE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>deletes the bookmark selected \</ahelp\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Help Page Not Found				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146957				0	ta	Could not find Help page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	ta	Unfortunately the Help page you selected was not found. The following data could be helpful in locating the error:				20200411 15:09:53
