helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541	16			0	ta	Click \<image id=\"img_id3148946\" src=\"res/sc06301.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148946\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>\<emph\>Back\</emph\> to return to the previous page.				20200411 15:09:53
