helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Improvement Program				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	bm_id7687094				0	ta	         \<bookmark_value\>online feedback options\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>options;improvement program\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>improvement program\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>feedback;automatically\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>user feedback;automatically\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200912315340				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/improvement.xhp\"\>Improvement Program\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200312315378				0	ta	The Improvement Program records some user interactions and sends them to the User Experience project.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594966				0	ta	The Improvement Program was initiated by the User Experience project to improve the usability of %PRODUCTNAME. The User Experience project can be found at the Apache OpenOffice website: \<link href=\"https://ux.openoffice.org/\"\>ux.openoffice.org/\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594946				0	ta	The second time you start your new %PRODUCTNAME software, you see a window that gives information about the Improvement Program. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200904094345				0	ta	At this time you can choose to accept or deny your participation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id052620090409438				0	ta	If you accept, data recording starts immediately. When you start a new session of %PRODUCTNAME, the collected data will be sent. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200904094433				0	ta	If you deny to participate, no data will be sent and recording of data stops immediately.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594945				0	ta	At any time, you can enable or disable the recording of user interaction data and the sending of these data. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Improvement Program\</item\>. Click the \<emph\>Info\</emph\> icon to browse to a web page with more information.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594944				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click \<emph\>Yes, I am willing to participate …\</emph\> to enable the automatic feedback.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595080				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click \<emph\>No, I do not wish to participate\</emph\> to disable the automatic feedback.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200903595037				0	ta	Tracked data				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200903595096				0	ta	The following data will be recorded and sent:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595033				0	ta	Clicks on toolbar buttons, including extension toolbars 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595014				0	ta	Execution of menu commands, including extension menus				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595145				0	ta	Clicks on context menu commands				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595115				0	ta	Fonts applied by using the menu 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595144				0	ta	Font sizes applied by using the menu 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595146				0	ta	Buttons, like OK, Cancel, etc. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595296				0	ta	Document language and paragraph language applied by using the menu or status bar 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595242				0	ta	Each recorded item also includes a time stamp and the module (Writer, Calc, Impress, …) where it has been called 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200903595229				0	ta	The following data will not be recorded and sent:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595234				0	ta	User names and passwords 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595218				0	ta	Any type of document content 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595213				0	ta	Paths, filenames 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595354				0	ta	User's source code 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200904021320				0	ta	Show Data				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595552				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click the button to show the currently collected data. This data will be sent next time, plus any data that gets collected until you end the current session.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Macro Security				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity.xhp	0	help	par_idN1054C				0	ta	\<variable id=\"macrosecurity\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/macrosecurity.xhp\"\>Macro Security\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056A				0	ta	The Macro Security dialog appears when a document contains one or more macros. You can also call the dialog from the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01030300.xhp\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Security\</link\>\</emph\> page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Formula				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150040				0	ta	%PRODUCTNAME Math Options				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	ta	\<variable id=\"druckentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SmEditOptions\"\>Defines the print format and print options for all new formula documents. These options apply when you print a formula directly from \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Math.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> You can also call the dialog by clicking the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> button in the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog. The settings you define in the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\</emph\> dialog will be permanent settings, whereas the settings in the Print dialog are only valid for the current document.				20200411 15:09:53
