helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153542				0	ta	The print settings defined on this tab page apply to all subsequent print jobs, until you change the settings again. If you want to change the settings for the current print job only, use the \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
