helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154939	12			0	ta	The password will be stored encrypted in a file called .ssop in your \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>home directory \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>"My Documents" folder\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20200411 15:09:53
