helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155449	12			0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:ED_SEARCH_NAME\"\>Displays the name of the selected search engine.\</ahelp\> This is the name that will be shown in the sub-menu of the \<emph\>Search\</emph\> icon on the Hyperlink bar. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151245				0	ta	Type				20200411 15:09:53
