helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_NO_COMP\"\>Specifies that no compression at all will occur.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	ta	Compress only punctuation				20200411 15:09:53
