helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	ta	If you have activated the snap grid but wish to move or create individual objects without snap positions, keep the Shift key pressed to deactivate this function for as long as needed.				20200411 15:09:53
