helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041	53			0	ta	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:CHECKBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_STD_PARAGRAPH:CB_AUTO\"\>Samodejno zamakne odstavek glede na velikost pisave in razmik vrstic. Nastavitev v polju \<emph\>Prva vrstica\</emph\> ni upoštevana.\</ahelp\>\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
