helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	ta	Če želite spremeniti privzeto pot do predlog, izberite \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Nastavitve\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Orodja - Možnosti\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010300.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Poti\"\>$[officename] - Poti\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
