helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06050600.xhp	0	help	par_id423291				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Izberite element, ki bo sledil oštevilčenju: tabulatorsko mesto, presledek ali nič.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
