helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154584				0	ta	... the content of the field is greater than or equal to the specified expression.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157964				0	ta	<=				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154052				0	ta	less than or equal to				20200411 15:09:53
