helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061E				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Creates an index with ASC or DESC statements.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
