helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151309				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_EXPX\"\>Inserts an exponential function with one placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>exp(<?>)\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10132				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3149687\" src=\"starmath/res/fu21508.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149687\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
