helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154702				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03080000.xhp\" name=\"AutoUpdate Display\"\>AutoUpdate Display\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154656				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Automatically updates a modified formula. If you do not select this option, the formula will only be updated after you choose \<emph\>View - Update\</emph\> or press F9.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
