helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144773				0	ta	Right				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155268				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:RADIOBUTTON:TP_LEGEND_POS:RBT_RIGHT\"\>Positions the legend at the right of the chart.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
