helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id3453169				0	ta	Choose a basic \<link href=\"text/schart/01/choose_chart_type.xhp\"\>chart type\</link\>: click any of the entries labeled Column, Bar, Pie, and so on.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id8406933				0	ta	The contents on the right side will change to offer more options depending on the basic chart type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id8230231				0	ta	Optionally, click any of the options. While you change the settings in the wizard, watch the preview in the document to see how the chart will look.				20200411 15:09:53
