helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id8141117				0	ta	When you create a chart that is based on default data, or when you copy a chart into your document, you can open the Data Table dialog to enter your own data. The chart responds to the data in a live preview.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id9487594				0	ta	Close the Chart Data dialog to apply all changes to the chart. Choose \<emph\>Edit - Undo\</emph\> to cancel the changes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id4149906				0	ta	Insert or select a chart that is not based on existing cell data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id6064943				0	ta	Choose \<emph\>View - Chart Data Table\</emph\> to open the Data Table dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3236182				0	ta	The data series are organized in columns. The role of the left most column is set to categories or data labels respectively. The contents of the left most column are always formatted as text. You can insert more text columns to be used as hierarchical labels.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id9799798				0	ta	Click a cell in the dialog and change the contents. Click another cell to see the changed contents in the preview.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id1251258				0	ta	Enter the name of the data series in the text box above the column.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id743430				0	ta	Use the icons above the table to insert or delete rows and columns. For data series with multiple columns, only whole data series can be inserted or deleted. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id8111819				0	ta	The order of the data series in the chart is the same as in the data table. Use the \<emph\>Move Series Right\</emph\> icon to switch the current column with its neighbor on the right.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id9116794				0	ta	The order of the categories or data points in the chart is the same as in the data table. Use the \<emph\>Move Row Down\</emph\> icon to switch the current row with its neighbor below.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150297				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a new row below the current row.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a new data series after the current column.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152297				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a new text column after the current column for hierarchical axes descriptions.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159231				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the current row. It is not possible to delete the label row.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153336				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the current series or text column. It is not possible to delete the first text column.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id4089175				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Switches the current column with its neighbor at the right.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3949095				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Switches the current row with its neighbor below.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id6697286				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter names for the data series.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Data Series				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150449				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/schart/01/05010200.xhp\" name=\"Data Series\"\>Data Series\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145750				0	ta	Use this to change the properties of a selected data series. This dialog appears when one data series is selected when you choose \<emph\>Format - Format Selection\</emph\>. Some of the menu entries are only available for 2D or 3D charts.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154015				0	ta	Any changes made here affect the entire data series. For example, if you change the color, all elements belonging to this data series will change color.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146916				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/schart/01/04050000.xhp\" name=\"Y Error Bars\"\>Y Error Bars\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
