helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3155089				0	ta	Determines the text flow of the data label.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148837				0	ta	Overlap				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151240				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:CHECKBOX:TP_AXIS_LABEL:CB_AXIS_LABEL_TEXTOVERLAP\"\>Specifies that the text in cells may overlap other cells.\</ahelp\> This can be especially useful if there is a lack of space. This option is not available with different title directions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157982				0	ta	Break				20200411 15:09:53
