helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_stock.xhp	0	help	hd_id5268410				0	ta	Stock				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_stock.xhp	0	help	par_id61342				0	ta	A Stock chart illustrates the market trend given by opening price, bottom price, top price and closing price. The transaction volume can also be shown.				20200411 15:09:53
