helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	hd_id3050325				0	ta	Smooth Line Properties				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id9421979				0	ta	In a chart that displays lines (Line type or XY type), you can choose to show curves instead of straight lines. Some options control the properties of those curves.				20200411 15:09:53
