helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149018	4			0	ta	To open the\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Draw \<emph\>Mode \</emph\>toolbar, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Effects \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar. In %PRODUCTNAME Impress, choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Mode\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150199				0	ta	Rotate				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148489				0	ta	Rotates or skews the selected 2D object(s) around a pivot point. Drag a corner handle of the object in the direction you want to rotate it. To skew an object, drag a center handle in the direction you want to skew it.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154022				0	ta	Each slide has only one pivot point. Double-click an object to move the pivot point to the center of the object. You can also drag the pivot point to a new location on the screen, and then rotate the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153914				0	ta	If you select a group that includes a 3D object, only the 3D object is rotated. You cannot skew a 3D object, instead, you can rotate it about the X and Y axes by dragging the center handles.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146962				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3153811\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_toggleobjectrotatemode.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153811\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150435				0	ta	Rotate				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151387				0	ta	Flip				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157874				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Mirror\"\>Flips the selected object(s) around a flip line, that you can drag to anywhere on the slide. Drag a handle of the object(s) across the flip line to flip the object(s). To change the orientation of the flip line, drag one of its end points to new location.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153035				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3153932\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_mirror.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153932\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145590				0	ta	Flip				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155263				0	ta	In 3D Rotation Object				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145169				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConvertInto3DLathe\"\>Converts the selected 2D object(s) to a 3D object, by rotating the object(s) around a symmetry line.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150332	36			0	ta	Drag the symmetry line to a new location to change the shape of the converted object. To change the orientation of the symmetry line, drag one of its end points. Click the object to convert it to 3D. 				20200411 15:09:53
