helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159153				0	ta	To create a flowchart:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3152482				0	ta	Select a tool from the \<emph\>Flowchart\</emph\> toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar.				20200411 15:09:53
