helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3154762				0	ta	To save a color list, click the \<emph\>Save Color List\</emph\> button, enter a filename, and then click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
