helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3155633				0	ta	A vector graphic can be resized without losing the quality of the graphic. In $[officename] Draw and Impress, you can convert a bitmap image into a vector graphic.				20200411 15:09:53
