helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	ta	Specifies the timing for the current effect in the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/effectoptions.xhp\"\>Effect Options\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057D				0	ta	Start				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066F				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"878841346\"\>Displays the start property of the selected animation effect.\</ahelp\> The following start properties are available:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10675				0	ta	\<emph\>On click\</emph\> - the animation stops at this effect until the next mouse click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067C				0	ta	\<emph\>With previous\</emph\> - the animation runs immediately.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10683				0	ta	\<emph\>After previous\</emph\> - the animation runs as soon as the previous animation ends.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10583				0	ta	Delay				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10693				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"878844420\"\>Specifies an additional delay of n seconds until the effect starts.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10587				0	ta	Speed				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A0				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"878841862\"\>Specifies the duration of the effect.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058B				0	ta	Repeat				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AD				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"878841864\"\>Specifies whether and how to repeat the current effect.\</ahelp\> Enter the number of repeats, or select from the list:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B3				0	ta	\<emph\>(none)\</emph\> - the effect is not repeated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BA				0	ta	\<emph\>Until next click\</emph\> - the animation is repeated until the next mouse click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C1				0	ta	\<emph\>Until end of slide\</emph\> - the animation repeats as long as the slide is displayed.				20200411 15:09:53
