helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\05250500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:BeforeObject\"\>Changes the stacking order by moving the selected object in front of an object that you specify. The screen location of the selected object does not change.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\05250500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153418	4			0	ta	Select the object(s) that you want to move to the foreground. Right-click and choose \<emph\>Arrange – In Front of Object\</emph\>, and then click an object in your slide.				20200411 15:09:53
