helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150297				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:METRICFIELD:DLG_MORPH:MTF_STEPS\"\>Enter the number of shapes you want between the two selected objects.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149211				0	ta	Cross-fade attributes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150207	8			0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:CHECKBOX:DLG_MORPH:CBX_ATTRIBUTES\"\>Applies cross-fading to the line and fill properties of the selected objects.\</ahelp\>For example, if the selected objects are filled with different colors, a color transition between the two colors is applied.				20200411 15:09:53
