helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144773				0	ta	\<variable id=\"effekttext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EffectWindow\"\>Assigns effects to selected objects.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1078E				0	ta	Animation List				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10792				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The animation list displays all animations for the current slide. \</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10798				0	ta	Each slide has one main animation that runs when the slide is shown.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079C				0	ta	More animations may be present, which run when a shape is shown. If any of these animated shapes are present, they are listed in the lower half of the animation list. Tabs display the name of each shape that runs an animation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079F				0	ta	Each list entry can consist of the following columns, from left to right:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A5				0	ta	An optional + character signals that the text paragraphs are animated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A9				0	ta	The second column shows the execution number of the animation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AD				0	ta	Column three shows a mouse icon if the animation is started by a mouse click, and a clock if the animation starts after the previous animation ends.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B1				0	ta	In column four, an icon shows the animation effect.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B5				0	ta	The fifth column shows the name of the shape for this animation effect and optionally the first characters of animated text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B8				0	ta	Add				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107BC				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/animationeffect.xhp\"\>Custom Animation\</link\> dialog to add another animation effect for the selected object on the slide.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107CD				0	ta	Change				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D1				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/animationeffect.xhp\"\>Custom Animation\</link\> dialog to change the animation effect for the selected entry on the animation list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E2				0	ta	Remove				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E6				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Removes the selected animation effects from the animation list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E9				0	ta	Start				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107ED				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the start property of the selected animation effect.\</ahelp\> The following start properties are available:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F3				0	ta	\<emph\>On click\</emph\> - the animation stops at this effect until the next mouse click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FA				0	ta	\<emph\>With previous\</emph\> - the animation runs immediately.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10801				0	ta	\<emph\>After previous\</emph\> - the animation runs as soon as the previous animation ends.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10807				0	ta	Property				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1080B				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Selects the additional properties of the animation. Click the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button to open the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/effectoptions.xhp\"\>Effect Options\</link\> dialog, where you can select and apply properties.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10820				0	ta	Speed				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10824				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the speed or duration of the selected animation effect.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
