helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153283				0	ta	Moves the cursor to the last cell on the sheet that contains data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149127				0	ta	Home				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159205				0	ta	Moves the cursor to the first cell of the current row.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149897				0	ta	End				20200411 15:09:53
