helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147411				0	ta	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Page Down				20200411 15:09:53
