helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id8055665				0	ta	Select the cell or a block of cells.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id9181188				0	ta	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Cells\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id9947508				0	ta	In the dialog, click the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id7907956				0	ta	Choose the border options you want to apply and click OK.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id1342204				0	ta	The options in the \<emph\>Line arrangement\</emph\> area can be used to apply multiple border styles.				20200411 15:09:53
