helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D1				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"26275\"\>Inserts a sheet from a different spreadsheet file.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F7				0	ta	Use the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01020000.xhp\"\>File - Open\</link\> dialog to locate the spreadsheet.				20200411 15:09:53
