helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3691824				0	ta	\<bookmark_value\>INFO function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id5787224				0	ta	INFO				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id1507309				0	ta	Returns specific information about the current working environment. The function receives a single text argument and returns data depending on that parameter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id7693411				0	ta	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3928952				0	ta	INFO("Type")				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id5206762				0	ta	The following table lists the values for the text parameter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Type\</item\> and the return values of the INFO function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id5735953				0	ta	Value for "Type"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id8360850				0	ta	Return value				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id9648731				0	ta	"osversion"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id908841				0	ta	Always "Windows (32-bit) NT 5.01", for compatibility reasons				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id8193914				0	ta	"system"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id9841608				0	ta	The type of the operating system. \<br/\>"WNT" for Microsoft Windows \<br/\>"LINUX" for Linux \<br/\>"SOLARIS" for Solaris				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id2701803				0	ta	"release"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id2136295				0	ta	The product release identifier, for example "300m25(Build:9876)"				20200411 15:09:53
