helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3144916				0	ta	\<emph\>ArrayX\</emph\> represents the first array whose elements are to be squared and added.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3144936				0	ta	\<emph\>ArrayY\</emph\> represents the second array whose elements are to be squared and subtracted.				20200411 15:09:53
