helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3157888				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_GLAETTEN\"\>Removes spaces from a string, leaving only a single space character between words.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
