helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968	4			0	ta	Select the table or the area in the table that you want to calculate subtotals for, and then choose \<emph\>Data – Subtotals\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3161831				0	ta	In the \<emph\>Group By\</emph\> box, select the column that you want to add the subtotals to.				20200411 15:09:53
