helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149689				0	ta	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148753				0	ta	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20200411 15:09:53
