helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150300				0	ta	Sort Ascending/Descending				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3158212				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SortDescending\"\>\<variable id=\"sytext\"\>Sorts the selection from the highest to the lowest value, or from the lowest to the highest value. Number fields are sorted by size and text fields by the order of the characters. You can define the sort rules on Data - Sort - Options.\</variable\>\</ahelp\> You define the default on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language settings - Languages.				20200411 15:09:53
