helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3149895				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_IMABS\"\>The result is the absolute value of a complex number.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
