helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3156111				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_COMPLEX\"\>The result is a complex number which is returned from a real coefficient and an imaginary coefficient.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
