helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150365				0	ta	Cell value is between $B$20 and $B$21: Cell style Result (The corresponding value limits must already exist in cells B20 and B21).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152992				0	ta	Formula is SUM($A$1:$A$5)=10: Cell style Result (The selected cells are formatted with the Result style if the sum of the contents in cells A1 to A5 is equal to 10).				20200411 15:09:53
