helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Data Field Options				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	bm_id711386				0	ta	\<bookmark_value\>hiding;data fields, from calculations in pivot table\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>display options in pivot table\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sorting;options in pivot table\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>data field options for pivot table\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10542				0	ta	Data Field Options				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10546				0	ta	You can specify additional options for column, row, and page data fields in the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090105.xhp\"\>pivot table\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10557				0	ta	Sort by				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055B				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387653\"\>Select the data field that you want to sort columns or rows by.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055E				0	ta	Ascending				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384580\"\>Sorts the values from the lowest value to the highest value. If the selected field is the field for which the dialog was opened, the items are sorted by name. If a data field was selected, the items are sorted by the resultant value of the selected data field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10565				0	ta	Descending				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10569				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384581\"\>Sorts the values descending from the highest value to the lowest value. If the selected field is the field for which the dialog was opened, the items are sorted by name. If a data field was selected, the items are sorted by the resultant value of the selected data field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056C				0	ta	Manual				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10570				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384582\"\>Sorts values alphabetically.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10585				0	ta	Display options				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10589				0	ta	You can specify the display options for all row fields except for the last, innermost row field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058C				0	ta	Layout				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10590				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387654\"\>Select the layout mode for the field in the list box.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10593				0	ta	Empty line after each item				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10597				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"1495385090\"\>Adds an empty row after the data for each item in the pivot table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059A				0	ta	Show automatically				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059E				0	ta	Displays the top or bottom nn items when you sort by a specified field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A1				0	ta	Show				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A5				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"1495385091\"\>Turns on the automatic show feature.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A8				0	ta	items				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105AC				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"1495390209\"\>Enter the maximum number of items that you want to show automatically.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105AF				0	ta	From				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B3				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387655\"\>Shows the top or bottom items in the specified sort order.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B6				0	ta	Using field				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BA				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387656\"\>Select the data field that you want to sort the data by.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BD				0	ta	Hide items				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C1				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"59010\"\>Select the items that you want to hide from the calculations.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C4				0	ta	Hierarchy				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C8				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387657\"\>Select the hierarchy that you want to use. The pivot table must be based on an external source data that contains data hierarchies.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
