helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	par_id3150606				0	ta	Intersection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	par_id3083445				0	ta	SUM(A1:B6!B5:C12)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	par_id3150385				0	ta	Calculates the sum of all cells in the intersection; in this example, the result yields the sum of cells B5 and B6.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	par_id4003723				0	ta	~ (Tilde)				20200411 15:09:53
