helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	par_id2511978				0	ta	Takes two references and returns a reference list, which is a concatenation of the left reference followed by the right reference. Double entries are referenced twice. See note below this table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	par_id181890				0	ta	Reference concatenation using a tilde character was implemented lately. When a formula with the tilde operator exists in a document that is opened in old versions of the software, an error is returned. A reference list is not allowed inside an array expression.				20200411 15:09:53
