helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156445				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_AUTOFORMAT:BTN_ALIGNMENT\"\>When marked, specifies that you want to retain the alignment of the selected format.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
