helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152994				0	ta	\<emph\>Filling cells using context menus:\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	ta	Call the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\> when positioned in a cell and choose \<emph\>Selection List\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156450				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DataSelect\"\>A list box containing all text found in the current column is displayed.\</ahelp\> The text is sorted alphabetically and multiple entries are listed only once.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	ta	Click one of the listed entries to copy it to the cell.				20200411 15:09:53
