helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05020600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_PROTECTION\"\>Defines protection options for selected cells.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
