helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3145118				0	ta	Double-click the text to edit it or to format text properties, such as font size or font color. Click the border of the text box to edit the object properties, such as border color or arranging in front or behind other objects.				20200411 15:09:53
