helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\14010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143228				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/14010000.xhp\" name=\"Cell Reference\"\>Cell Reference\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\14010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149052				0	ta	Displays the position of the cell cursor in a table.				20200411 15:09:53
