helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\06140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145249				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NumberingStart\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Restarts the text numbering.\</ahelp\> This is only visible when the cursor is positioned within numbered or bulleted text.				20200411 15:09:53
