helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\03210000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149873				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ChainFrames\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Links the selected frame to the next frame.\</ahelp\> The text automatically flows from one frame to another.				20200411 15:09:53
