helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146899				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoSum\"\>Activates the sum function. Note that the cursor must be in the cell where you want the sum to appear.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154504				0	ta	\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> recognizes the cell range for the sum function as long as the cells are filled with numbers. Prior to entering the data, you must enable the \<emph\>Number Recognition\</emph\> in the context menu of the table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771				0	ta	Click \<emph\>Apply\</emph\> to accept the sum formula as it appears in the entry line.				20200411 15:09:53
