helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149099				0	ta	Print options page view				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148975				0	ta	Distribution				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153634				0	ta	Determines the number of rows and columns to print, as well as the print size. You can also choose to print several document pages on one printed page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152771				0	ta	Rows				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155141				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_PAGEPREVIEW_PRINTOPTIONS:NF_ROWS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Defines the number of rows of pages (horizontally stacked document pages).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145780				0	ta	Columns				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155916				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_PAGEPREVIEW_PRINTOPTIONS:NF_COLS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Defines the number of pages shown in columns (vertically tiled document pages).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150117				0	ta	Margins				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155859				0	ta	The print margins can be determined in this area.				20200411 15:09:53
