helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id1031200810571916				0	ta	To move the cursor, press the key or key combination given in the following table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id1031200810571929				0	ta	To select the characters under the moving cursor, additionally hold down the Shift key when you move the cursor.				20200411 15:09:53
