helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3145409				0	ta	Moves the cursor to the beginning of the contents of the current cell. Press again to move the cursor to the first cell in the table. Press again to move the cursor to the beginning of the document.				20200411 15:09:53
