helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149609	37			0	ta	Choose \<emph\>Table - Insert - Table\</emph\>. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149858				0	ta	In the \<emph\>Size\</emph\> area, enter the number of rows and columns.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145097				0	ta	Select the options that you want, click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
