helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149688				0	ta	\<variable id=\"template_create\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/template_create.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Document Template\"\>Creating a Document Template\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149492				0	ta	You can create a template to use as the basis for creating new text documents.				20200411 15:09:53
