helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149687				0	ta	\<variable id=\"indices_literature\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/indices_literature.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Bibliography\"\>Creating a Bibliography\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3155864				0	ta	A bibliography is a list of works that you reference in a document.				20200411 15:09:53
