helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3154248				0	ta	Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New User-defined Index\</item\> button next to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Index\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3155886				0	ta	Type a name for the index in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Name\</item\> box and click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3147114	52			0	ta	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> to add the selected word(s) to the new index. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3147139				0	ta	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
