helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154922				0	ta	\<variable id=\"insert_graphic\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/insert_graphic.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Graphics\"\>Inserting Graphics\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
