helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154849				0	ta	Press the right arrow key until the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> icon is selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155872				0	ta	Press the down arrow key, and then use the arrow keys to select the number of columns and rows to include in the table.				20200411 15:09:53
