helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153411	3			0	ta	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</item\>               \<emph\>.\</emph\>            				20200411 15:09:53
