helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149641				0	ta	In the list of page styles, right-click an item, and then choose \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149614				0	ta	On the \<emph\>Organizer\</emph\> tab, type a name in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
