helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3145808				0	ta	If you want to increase the spacing between footnote or endnote texts, you can add a top and bottom border to the corresponding paragraph style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155603				0	ta	Click in a footnote or endnote.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155620				0	ta	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3154251				0	ta	Right-click the Paragraph Style that you want to modify, for example, "Footnote", and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155884				0	ta	Click the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"Borders\"\>\<emph\>Borders\</emph\>\</link\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3147110				0	ta	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Default\</item\> area, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Set Top and Bottom Borders Only\</item\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150931				0	ta	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Line\</item\> area, click a line in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150961				0	ta	Select "White" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Color\</item\> box. If the background of the page is not white, select the color that best matches the background color.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150519				0	ta	In the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area, clear the \<emph\>Synchronize\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150709				0	ta	Enter a value in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Top\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Bottom\</item\> boxes.				20200411 15:09:53
