helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_cusaddlis.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Customize Address List				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_cusaddlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN1053C				0	ta	Customize Address List				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_cusaddlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN10540				0	ta	Customizes the address list for \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mm_newaddlis.xhp\"\>mail merge\</link\> documents.				20200411 15:09:53
