helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_newaddlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN10574				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click the buttons to navigate through the records or enter a record number to display a record.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
