helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3152999				0	ta	Conditional text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149881	6			0	ta	Inserts text if a certain \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>condition\</link\> is met. For example, enter "sun eq 1" in the \<emph\>Condition\</emph\> box, and then the text that you want to insert when the variable "sun" equals "1" in the \<emph\>Then \</emph\>box. If you want, you can also enter the text that you want to display when this condition is not met in the \<emph\>Else\</emph\> box. To define the variable "sun", click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090005.xhp\" name=\"Variables\"\>\<emph\>Variables\</emph\>\</link\> tab, select "Set variable", type "sun" in the\<emph\> Name\</emph\> box, and its value in the\<emph\> Value\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153719				0	ta	Input list				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147564				0	ta	Inserts a text field that displays one item from a list. You can add, edit, and remove items, and change their order in the list. Click an \<emph\>Input list\</emph\> field in your document or press Ctrl+Shift+F9 to display the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090003.xhp\" name=\"Choose Item\"\>\<emph\>Choose Item\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153146				0	ta	Input field				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149287				0	ta	Inserts a text field that you can open by \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090100.xhp\" name=\"clicking\"\>clicking\</link\> it in the document. You can then change the text that is displayed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3154691				0	ta	Execute macro				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147515	10			0	ta	Inserts a text field that runs a macro when you click the field in the document. To assign a macro to the field, click the \<emph\>Macro\</emph\> button. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3152946				0	ta	Placeholder				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	ta	Inserts a placeholder field in the document, for example, for graphics. When you click a placeholder field in the document, you are prompted to insert the item that is missing.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3150973				0	ta	Hidden text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147524				0	ta	Inserts a text field that is hidden when the condition that you specify is met. To use this function, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\> and clear the \<emph\>Fields: Hidden text\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3154480				0	ta	Hidden Paragraph				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153677				0	ta	Hides a paragraph when the condition that you specify is met. To use this function, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\> and clear the \<emph\>Fields: Hidden paragraph\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3154192	39			0	ta	Combine characters 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3159199				0	ta	Combines up to 6 characters, so that they behave as a single character. This feature is only available when Asian fonts are supported.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id0902200804352213				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click the format that you want to apply to the selected field, or click "Additional formats" to define a custom format.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3151329				0	ta	For function fields, the format field is only used for fields of the type placeholder. Here, the format determines the object for which the placeholder stands.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149494				0	ta	Condition				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3143281				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_FLD_DB:ED_DBCONDITION\"\>For fields linked to a \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>condition\</link\>, enter the criteria here.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151248				0	ta	Then, Else				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3154830	21			0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_EDIT_TP_FLD_FUNC_ED_FUNCCOND2\"\>Enter the text to display when the condition is met in the \<emph\>Then \</emph\>box, and the text to display when the condition is not met in the \<emph\>Else \</emph\>box.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3146865	22			0	ta	You can also insert database fields in the \<emph\>Then \</emph\>and \<emph\>Else \</emph\>boxes using the format "databasename.tablename.fieldname".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147583				0	ta	If the table or the field name does not exist in a database, nothing is inserted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3152585				0	ta	If you include the quotes in "databasename.tablename.fieldname", the expression is inserted as text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155136				0	ta	Reference				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3155149	27			0	ta	Type the text that you want to display in the field. If you are inserting a placeholder field, type the text that you want to display as a help tip when you rest the mouse pointer over the field. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147071				0	ta	Format				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147084				0	ta	Select the macro that you want to run when the field is clicked.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154384				0	ta	Macro name				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153351				0	ta	Displays the name of the selected macro.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156269				0	ta	Placeholder				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3156282				0	ta	Type the text that you want to appear in the placeholder field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150587				0	ta	Hidden text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149173				0	ta	Type the text that you want to hide if a condition is met.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151028				0	ta	Characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3145771				0	ta	Enter the characters that you want to combine. You can combine a maximum of 6 characters. This option is only available for the \<emph\>Combine characters\</emph\> field type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156369				0	ta	Value				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3151370				0	ta	Enter a value for the selected field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148877				0	ta	Macro				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3155912				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_TP_FLD_FUNC_BT_FUNCMACRO\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Macro Selector\</emph\>, where you can choose the macro that will run when you click the selected field in the document.\</ahelp\> This button is only available for the "Execute macro" function field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3150111				0	ta	The following controls are displayed for \<emph\>Input list\</emph\> fields:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155860				0	ta	Item				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3150688				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_EDIT_TP_FLD_FUNC_ED_LISTITEM\"\>Enter a new item.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147413				0	ta	Add				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147473				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_TP_FLD_FUNC_PB_LISTADD\"\>Adds the \<emph\>Item\</emph\> to the list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147496				0	ta	Items on list				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147618				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_FLD_FUNC_LB_LISTITEMS\"\>Lists the items. The topmost item is shown in the document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145263				0	ta	Remove				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149558				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_TP_FLD_FUNC_PB_LISTREMOVE\"\>Removes the selected item from the list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145126				0	ta	Move Up				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3155970				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_TP_FLD_FUNC_PB_LISTUP\"\>Moves the selected item up in the list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150549				0	ta	Move Down				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3156221				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_TP_FLD_FUNC_PB_LISTDOWN\"\>Moves the selected item down in the list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149215				0	ta	Name				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147733				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_EDIT_TP_FLD_FUNC_ED_LISTNAME\"\>Enter a unique name for the \<emph\>Input list\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146332				0	ta	Choose Item				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147455	65			0	ta	This dialog is shown when you click an \<emph\>Input list\</emph\> field in the document. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149837				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_DLG_FLD_DROPDOWN_LB_LISTITEMS\"\>Choose the item that you want to display in the document, then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147602				0	ta	Edit				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3148855				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_FLD_DROPDOWN_PB_EDIT\"\>Displays the \<emph\>Edit Fields: Functions\</emph\> dialog, where you can edit the \<emph\>Input list\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155558				0	ta	Next				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3148434				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_FLD_DROPDOWN_PB_NEXT\"\>Closes the current \<emph\>Input list\</emph\> and displays the next, if available.\</ahelp\> You see this button when you open the \<emph\>Choose Item\</emph\> dialog by Ctrl+Shift+F9.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03130000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Print Layout				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150018				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03130000.xhp\" name=\"Print Layout\"\>Print Layout\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145249				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PrintLayout\"\>Displays how the document will look when you print it.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ta	Variables				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	bm_id8526261				0	ta	\<bookmark_value\>user-defined fields, restriction\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153716				0	ta	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090005.xhp\" name=\"Variables\"\>Variables\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150764				0	ta	Variable fields let you add dynamic content to your document. For example, you can use a variable to reset the page numbering.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149759				0	ta	User-defined fields are only available in the current document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id0903200802243625				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the available field types. To add a field to your document, click a field type, click a field in the \<emph\>Select \</emph\>list, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150703				0	ta	Type				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154096				0	ta	Description				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149803				0	ta	Set Variable				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150996				0	ta	Defines a variable and its value. You can change the value of a variable by clicking in front of the variable field, and then choosing \<emph\>Edit - Field\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154571				0	ta	Show Variable				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3153669	9			0	ta	Inserts the current value of the variable that you click in the \<emph\>Selection \</emph\>list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3147531				0	ta	DDE field				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149684				0	ta	Inserts a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#dde\" name=\"DDE\"\>DDE\</link\> link into the document, that you can update as often as you want through the assigned name.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3159196				0	ta	Insert Formula				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3151322				0	ta	Inserts a fixed number, or the result of a formula.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149494				0	ta	Input field				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154829				0	ta	Inserts a new value for a variable or a User Field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149098				0	ta	The value of a variable in an Input field is only valid from where the field is inserted and onwards. To change the value of the variable later in the document, insert another Input field of the same name, but with a different value. However, the value of a User Field is changed globally.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3151255				0	ta	The variables are displayed in the \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> field. When you click the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> button, the dialog\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090100.xhp\" name=\"Input Field\"\>\<emph\>Input Field\</emph\>\</link\> appears, where you can enter the new value or additional text as a remark.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149034				0	ta	Number range				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3152772				0	ta	Inserts automatic numbering for tables, graphics, or text frames.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3147073				0	ta	Set page variable				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154389				0	ta	Inserts a reference point in the document, after which the page count restarts. Select "on" to enable the reference point, and "off" to disable it. You can also enter an offset to start the page count at a different number.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3156267				0	ta	Show Page Variable				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150588				0	ta	Displays the number of pages from the "Set page variable" reference point to this field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3145779				0	ta	User Field				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3151377				0	ta	Inserts a custom global variable. You can use the User Field to define a variable for a condition statement. When you change a User Field, all instances of the variable in the document are updated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id0903200802243892				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click the format that you want to apply to the selected field, or click "Additional formats" to define a custom format.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3148886	25			0	ta	For user-defined fields, click the format that you want to apply in the \<emph\>Format \</emph\>list, or click "Additional formats" to define a custom format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id0903200802243880				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Type the name of the user-defined field that you want to create.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id0903200802243951				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the contents that you want to add to a user-defined field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3155860				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_FLD_VAR_LB_VARFORMAT\"\>In the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> list, define if the value is inserted as text or a number.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3888363				0	ta	Selection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id7453535				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_FLD_DOK:LB_DOKSELECTION\"\>Lists the available fields for the field type selected in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list. To insert a field, click the field, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3326822				0	ta	To quickly insert a field from the list, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and double-click the field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150696	36			0	ta	In an HTML document, two additional fields are available for the "Set variable" field type: HTML_ON and HTML_OFF. The text that you type in the \<emph\>Value \</emph\>box is converted to an opening HTML \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#tags\" name=\"tag\"\>tag\</link\> (<Value>) or to a closing HTML (</Value>) tag when the file is saved as an HTML document, depending on the option that you select.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149555				0	ta	If you double-click an entry while holding the Ctrl key or select the desired variable and press the spacebar, it is immediately inserted into your document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155969				0	ta	Formula				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3155982				0	ta	This option is only available if the "Insert formula" field type is selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149229				0	ta	Invisible				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3156233				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_FLD_VAR_CB_VARINVISIBLE\"\>Hides the field contents in the document.\</ahelp\> The field is inserted as a thin gray mark in the document. This option is only available for the "Set Variable" and "User Field" field types.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146326				0	ta	Chapter numbering				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3146340				0	ta	Sets the options for resetting chapter numbers.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147456				0	ta	Level				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149836				0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_FLD_VAR_LB_VARCHAPTERLEVEL\"\>Choose the heading or chapter level at which to restart numbering in the document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147594				0	ta	Separator				20200411 15:09:53
