helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149849				0	ta	To change the format of a footnote or endnote anchor or text, select it, and then choose \<emph\>Format - Character\</emph\>. You can press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+T\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>F11\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> to open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window and modify the footnote or endnote paragraph style.				20200411 15:09:53
