helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153308				0	ta	Select the type of note to insert, that is, footnote or endnote. A footnote is placed at the bottom of the current page, whereas an endnote is placed at the end of the document.				20200411 15:09:53
