helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150979				0	ta	The \<emph\>Format\</emph\> button is only available for outline numbering. For numbered or bulleted list styles, modify the Numbering Styles of the paragraphs.				20200411 15:09:53
