helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145188	39			0	ta	If you want, you can enter an \<emph\>Offset \</emph\>for the displayed page number. With an \<emph\>Offset\</emph\> value of 1, the field will display a number that is 1 more than the current page number, but only if a page with that number exists. On the last page of the document, this same field will be empty.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150891				0	ta	Offset				20200411 15:09:53
