helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155901				0	ta	Character Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149692				0	ta	You can assign styles to endnote anchors and text. You can use the predefined endnote styles, or use a different style.				20200411 15:09:53
