helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151177				0	ta	\<variable id=\"optionentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_CAPTION:BTN_OPTION\"\>Adds the chapter number to the caption label. To use this feature, you must first assign an \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/chapter_numbering.xhp\" name=\"outline level\"\>outline level\</link\> to a paragraph style, and then apply the style to the chapter headings in your document.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149805				0	ta	Numbering by chapter				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153532				0	ta	When you add chapter numbers to caption labels, the caption numbering is reset when a chapter heading is encountered. For example, if the last figure in chapter 1 is "Figure 1.12", the first figure in the next chapter would be "Figure 2.1".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154574				0	ta	Level				20200411 15:09:53
