helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150300.xhp	0	help	par_id3152999	2			0	ta	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoFormatRedlineApply\"\>Automatically formats the file according to the options that you set under \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>\<emph\> Options\</emph\>. In a dialog, you are asked to accept or reject the changes.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
