helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145117				0	ta	\<image id=\"img_id3149575\" src=\"res/helpimg/sc10617.png\" width=\"0.583in\" height=\"0.333in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149575\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
